  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bio-Innovate 2010-2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bio-Innovate2010-2016 - Bio-Innovate 2010-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bio-resurser Innovations n&#xe4;tverk f&#xf6;r &#xd6;stafrika utveckling &#xe4;r en       tv&#xe4;rvetenskaplig forskning och innovation finansieringsmekanism f&#xf6;r   biovetenskaper och produktorienterad innovationer i Kenya, Uganda,    Tanzania, Rwanda, Burundi och Ethiopia. BIO-INNOVATE nisch &#xe4;r fokus   p&#xe5; till&#xe4;mpningar av bio-resurser innovationer f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja h&#xe5;llbar  tillv&#xe4;xt och anpassningsf&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga till klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Bio-resources Innovations Network for Eastern Africa Development  is a multidisciplinary research and innovation competitive funding    mechanism for biosciences and product oriented innovation activities  in Kenya, Uganda, Tanzania, Rwanda, Burundi and Ethiopia. The         BIO-INNOVATE niche is a focus on applications of bio-resources        innovations to support sustainable growth and adaptability to climate</narrative>
  </description>
